urn to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1423191,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAgWJhUSQWCgtKR8170nMkYlBda.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1058424,\"title\":\"Hope\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VY1ZKgpsc8CfGsQcCGiYEgHdH0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qqHFLg90IUSoTmSMpKOOW5RyqN3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor, police chief Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious creature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems, and perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1381071,\"title\":\"Godzilla Minus Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":687163,\"title\":\"Project Hail Mary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOb2fjXLbpJgyQXe46n1WtGCnaa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2I1OFQJ0L9T0dpU6FobKFWV2PxX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":755898,\"title\":\"War of the Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvirUYrva23IudARHn3mMGVxWqM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iZLqwEwUViJdSkGVjePGhxYzbDb.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Will Radford is a top analyst for Homeland Security who tracks potential threats through a mass surveillance program, until one day an attack by an unknown entity leads him to question whether the government is hiding something from him... and from the rest of the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"NdVKaSSlC90\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nluWiz6HClQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gdv7PcGa4LY\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}